DOMAIN: Volk, Nation, Culture, and the Politics of Herder's Legacy
SEARCH_DATE: 2026-06-09
PAPERS_FOUND: 14 total (High: 9, Medium: 4, Low: 1)
SEARCH_SOURCES: SEP, PhilPapers, Semantic Scholar, OpenAlex, CrossRef
